<title>USA: Avondale Financial completes securitization.</title>
<headline>Avondale Financial completes securitization.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avondale Financial Corp said it has completed an $80.3 million asset securitization backed by home equity lines-of-credit offered by the bank.</p>
<p>The certificates were issued by Avondale Home Equity Loan Trust 1997-1, a trust formed specifically for the purposes of securitization, the financial services company said.</p>
<p>The securitization is the company's second in six months, Avondale said.</p>
<p>Avondale shares were down 1/4 at 13-1/4 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
